msgid "Example: Disaggregated prefill"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/legacy/getting_started/quickstart/disaggregated_prefill.rst:8
msgid ""
"This page documents the behavior of LMCache's in-process mode "
"(deprecated). Please consider using :doc:`LMCache MP mode </mp/index>` "
"for better feature support and performance. For the MP mode equivalent of"
" this page, see :doc:`/mp/disaggregated_prefill`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/legacy/getting_started/quickstart/disaggregated_prefill.rst:11
msgid ""
"With LMCache as a KV cache transfer library, we can run disaggregated "
"prefill with vLLM. Right now, LMCache uses NIXL as a transport layer to "
"enable fast KV cache transfer via NVLink, RDMA, or TCP."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/legacy/getting_started/quickstart/disaggregated_prefill.rst:14
msgid ""
"This guide demonstrates how to run LMCache with disaggregated prefill "
"using a single prefiller and decoder setup (1P1D) on a single machine. "
"The architecture splits the LLM inference into two stages: prefill and "
"decode, running on separate GPUs for better resource utilization."
msgstr ""

